                            <p class="sub-title text-light text-20px">WHAT IS TO2?</p>
                            <h3 class="heading">AN EFFECTIVE, EASY TO USE WOUND THERAPY</h3>
                            <p>Studies demonstrate that concentration of oxygen at the wound site increases the local cellular oxygen tension, which in turn promotes wound healing. TO2 is the application of oxygen directly to the wound site for 90 minutes per day over 4 consecutive days followed by 3 days rest. This cycle is repeated until complete wound healing or your doctor discontinues therapy. TO2 is suitable for all healthcare environments and is most often prescribed for in-home treatment and administered by the patient or with the help of another. This eliminates the need for costly ambulatory care, patient transportation or home nursing visits. </p>
                        </div>
