                            <h3 class="heading">ADVANTAGES OF TO2</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Oxygen is applied topically vs. systemically (eliminates risk of systemic oxygen toxicity) </li>
                                <li>Cost-effective </li>
                                <li>Non-invasive therapy </li>
                                <li>Easy to use in any setting</li>
                                <li>Home-based treatment benefits: off-loading, hospital and transportation cost-savings, comfort of being in one’s home</li>
                                <li>One-time use, disposable devices</li>
                                <li>Anti-microbial effect </li>
                            </ul>
